	<FilterPreset ObjectID="7859" ClassID="ee52a7d2-069e-47f7-aa30-e3e3286b65a3" Version="3">
		<Description>In Out - Use '1. Main Preset' underneath and place this on the 3rd, top adjustment layer.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Offset - Single (recommended 12 frames long) adjustment layer over clips.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Big Roll - Single (recommended 12 frames long) adjustment layer over clips.</Description>
